               <title>RECOMMENDED STORAGE</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Store at controlled room temperature, 20°-25°C (68°-77°F) [See USP Controlled Room Temperature]. After opening, store away from direct light. Close tightly after each use. REFRIGERATION IS NOT REQUIRED.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">TAMPER EVIDENT:</content> Do not use if seal under cap is torn, broken or missing.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250915"/>
            </section>
